{"source":"github","project_id":"tfautograph","target":"t-kalinowski/tfautograph","id":"pr/1","ref":1,"title":"Use if as the last expression","description":"@t-kalinowski Maybe this will be dealed with early returns, but I think this should also work.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfn \u003c- function(n) {\r\n    if (n \u003e 0L)\r\n      -n\r\n    else\r\n      2L * n\r\n  }\r\n  ag_fn \u003c- autograph(fn)\r\n\r\n  expect_result(ag_fn, as_tensor(1L), -1)\r\n  expect_result(ag_fn, as_tensor(-1L), -2L)\r\n```","published_at":"2019-06-20T09:50:00Z","updated_at":"2019-06-23T17:23:37Z","url":"https://github.com/t-kalinowski/tfautograph/pull/1","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"dfalbel","merged_at":"2019-06-23T17:23:37Z","state":"MERGED"}}
